{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1000_p", "source_sha256": "76c9762430c7275b05184b8bf8a46654f69155aaee972f83e209b4df3eac2070", "ja": "（チアライブは、ツアーの合間を縫って続いている。\n今日は久々の休みだけど……ん？　あそこにいるのは）", "zh": "（啦啦队Live一直在巡演的间隙中持续进行。今天难得休息一下，不过……嗯？那边的人是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "18d34f3e1c96494132e46e36ff149ddc23ea1b48a46e48b049d67277f8e7408e", "ja": "チアライブで、みんな元気～♪　可奈もやる気～♪\n……あ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "在应援现场，大家都精神满满～♪ 可奈也干劲十足～♪\n……啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1002_p", "source_sha256": "665d694c2d1a03a087ba49fae0dd1311eae848f83995b0c184968f77fee8c137", "ja": "お疲れさま、可奈。\n休みなのに元気だな！", "zh": "辛苦了，可奈。\n明明休息还这么有精神啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "7c09069fa83e67e445d31f41c12dee72d035134c01418f3f5b08791e7e4e97b5", "ja": "えへ、そうなんです♪\n今日も、元気いっぱいなんですよー！", "zh": "诶嘿，是这样的♪  \n今天也活力满满哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "cef121edf1f6c83bd7ab7e8fe7983dc95dfcf55c81d2aef89bf56f60fe01dfc9", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n応援が必要だったら、いつでも言ってくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n要是需要加油打气的话，请随时跟我说哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f33b3aed6fedd46dd6e59ba0f0fab4e97a466c4bd44f0e080ad06e9a55b98f5f", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう！　可奈こそ、ライブ続きだからな。\n休みの日ぐらい、ちゃんと休まないと。", "zh": "啊，谢谢！可奈你才是，最近一直在连着开演唱会。至少休息日要好好休息才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "cc60f0e313d9da52039390ee4bb3b67db2641930e5ffded3f5041881728fda59", "ja": "は～い！　でも、不思議なんですよ～。\n応援してると、私まで元気になるっていうか……。", "zh": "好——！不过，真奇怪呀～。给别人加油的时候，我好像连自己也会变得有精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "d53b790ded426aa68b220d32cdfeae1de9eac8faab1dc67f212a9543fa762f00", "ja": "今日も、全然疲れたって気がしなくて。\nどうしてなんでしょう？", "zh": "今天也完全感觉不到累。\n这是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fa38fe3ab7a0d7d9e40b26de5611e68be4aab9067efddfb156b16c79156aea9f", "ja": "それは可奈が、チアライブを\n心から楽しめてるって事じゃないかな。いい事だよ。", "zh": "那是因为可奈真的打心底享受啦啦队演出吧。这是件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a15629af3b028e17d14ac148a305dccdc45f4f667fd8eb9e7f33fa2054c7ffac", "ja": "でも、そうだな……たまには、\n自分を応援してみるのもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过，这么说吧……偶尔为自己加加油，也不错，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "52c91348e63d748885a1a4f232f68f372c866e35bbf7c082a8b404adff27df15", "ja": "自分を……私が、私を応援するんですか？", "zh": "为自己……我来给我自己加油吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b04a4314b66d3715f9be67f755502c2eb50c5d26af60096c463ec91232fc363b", "ja": "周りから見ていると、みんなを応援してる可奈は、\nすごく頑張ってるように見えるから。", "zh": "从旁人看来，为大家加油打气的可奈，\n显得非常努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a97485fa729e8af90b9e5659037e058be16c421c52df15f8bca95a3c6edbd248", "ja": "たまには「お疲れ様」って言ってあげても\nいいんじゃないかな？　人に甘えてみたりとか……。", "zh": "偶尔对她说一句“辛苦了”，\n不也挺好的吗？也可以试着依赖一下别人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "4dad42dc330b21b5814155abf02792fb23456b5dbac950d9e88b16d4ae845634", "ja": "なるほど～、わかりました！\nじゃあ……{$P$}さん！", "zh": "原来如此～我明白了！\n那么……{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "05da046a4e532bdccbeb5ca30eee22815c8a2f3c687aad69a5a9e5c0baf45f7a", "ja": "ちょっぴりでいいので、私のこと、ほめてください！\n「応援、がんばっててえらいぞ！」って♪", "zh": "哪怕只夸我一点点也好，请夸夸我吧！\n就说“你一直努力为大家加油，真了不起！”之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2c70aeaf0c57ef68945cf55263e804f70e12146e1a456f5d3002166e9819ec05", "ja": "もちろん！　他の人を元気にできるのは、\nすごいことだからな。偉いぞ、可奈！", "zh": "当然！能让别人打起精神来，是一件很了不起的事。可奈，你做得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "514ae17ea7e958968929cac9172c080f280e30261ba1b76d3edfdacd03530846", "ja": "えへ、えへへへ……♪　{$P$}さんに\nほめられたら、なんだか元気が出てきました！", "zh": "嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……♪ 被{$P$}先生夸奖后，不知怎么就打起精神来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "fbc7733045217c56030056dc434a82556ecab8a30738e00378e3c4bd46ea0ad4", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　私、これからも\nみんなのこと、たくさん応援できそうです♪", "zh": "谢谢您！这样一来，我今后好像也能为大家加油打气了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "aa135c3042593246f072da475dcab15fe39b513b9e754aac55194912164fc0e4", "ja": "元気が出たぞ～、がんばるぞ～！\nみんなのところへ～、ゴーゴゴ～♪", "zh": "打起精神来啦～要加油啦～！\n向大家那边出发～冲呀冲呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0323_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1d1225d85ef55821c3788f025a02bc3b7d59f462179fd3ccb2309b03ded30e89", "ja": "（みんなを応援し続ける可奈にも、時として応援は\n必要だ。あの明るい笑顔、支えていかないとな……！）", "zh": "就连一直为大家加油的可奈，有时也需要别人为她加油。那灿烂的笑容，我也得好好支持她才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
